;; Handwritten SIMD WebAssembly kernels for Butteraugli (baMetricBands, baMetricMask, baMetricDiff, baMetricDown, baMetricMix).
;; Caller-owned memory layout (BA_MEMORY): tie scratch 1056..1104 below linear (131072), zero musl routines or stack pointer.
